{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b8c04e8e-2026-4b1a-9a55-peluqueria2026",
    "name": "TPI Peluquería y Fidelización 2026",
    "description": "Colección completa, parametrizada y reproducible para evaluar el TPI de Backend de Aplicaciones (UTN FRC).\n\nCubre:\n1. Autenticación OIDC/JWT contra Keycloak (guardado automático de tokens).\n2. Control de acceso y seguridad (401 y 403).\n3. Flujo de negocio central extremo a extremo (reserva, completitud con acreditación, reserva con canje de descuento y cancelación con reintegro).\n4. Reglas de negocio y rechazos controlados (RN-01, RN-02, RN-03, RN-04 y 503).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Autenticación Keycloak (OIDC / JWT)",
      "description": "Obtiene los tokens JWT para ROLE_CLIENTE y ROLE_ADMIN y los almacena automáticamente en las variables de entorno {{token_cliente}} y {{token_admin}}.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1.1 Login Cliente (ROLE_CLIENTE)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Login Cliente exitoso (200 OK)', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('token_cliente', jsonData.access_token);",
                  "pm.environment.set('token_cliente', jsonData.access_token);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "client_id", "value": "peluqueria-client", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "grant_type", "value": "password", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "username", "value": "cliente1", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "password", "value": "cliente123", "type": "text" }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{keycloak_url}}/realms/peluqueria-realm/protocol/openid-connect/token",
              "host": ["{{keycloak_url}}"],
              "path": ["realms", "peluqueria-realm", "protocol", "openid-connect", "token"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.2 Login Administrador (ROLE_ADMIN)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Login Admin exitoso (200 OK)', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('token_admin', jsonData.access_token);",
                  "pm.environment.set('token_admin', jsonData.access_token);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "client_id", "value": "peluqueria-client", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "grant_type", "value": "password", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "username", "value": "admin1", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "password", "value": "admin123", "type": "text" }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{keycloak_url}}/realms/peluqueria-realm/protocol/openid-connect/token",
              "host": ["{{keycloak_url}}"],
              "path": ["realms", "peluqueria-realm", "protocol", "openid-connect", "token"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Seguridad y Control de Acceso",
      "description": "Demuestra el comportamiento ante solicitudes sin token (401 Unauthorized) y con permisos insuficientes según el rol (403 Forbidden).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "2.1 Solicitud Sin Token -> 401 Unauthorized",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Rechaza petición sin credenciales con 401 Unauthorized', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(401);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{gateway_url}}/api/peluqueros",
              "host": ["{{gateway_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "peluqueros"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2.2 ROLE_CLIENTE intenta crear Peluquero -> 403 Forbidden",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Rechaza a ROLE_CLIENTE en endpoint exclusivo de ADMIN con 403 Forbidden', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(403);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token_cliente}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Peluquero No Autorizado\",\n  \"emailCalendar\": \"noautorizado@peluqueria.com\",\n  \"activo\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{gateway_url}}/api/peluqueros",
              "host": ["{{gateway_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "peluqueros"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2.3 ROLE_CLIENTE intenta crear Premio -> 403 Forbidden",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Rechaza a ROLE_CLIENTE al administrar catálogo de premios con 403 Forbidden', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(403);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token_cliente}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Premio Intruso\",\n  \"puntosRequeridos\": 10,\n  \"porcentajeDescuento\": 90.00,\n  \"activo\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{gateway_url}}/api/premios",
              "host": ["{{gateway_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "premios"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Flujo Principal del MVP de Punta a Punta",
      "description": "Recorre el proceso central de negocio:\n1. Consulta de catálogos.\n2. Reserva de turno sin canje.\n3. Completar turno (ADMIN) y acreditación automática de +100 puntos en ms-premios.\n4. Consulta de saldo e historial en ms-premios.\n5. Reserva de nuevo turno canjeando premio #1 (10% de descuento por 100 puntos).\n6. Cancelación del turno con premio y reintegro automático de los 100 puntos.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "3.1 Consultar Peluqueros Disponibles (GET)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Devuelve catálogo de peluqueros (200 OK)', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().length).to.be.above(0);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token_cliente}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{gateway_url}}/api/peluqueros",
              "host": ["{{gateway_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "peluqueros"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3.2 Consultar Servicios Disponibles (GET)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Devuelve catálogo de servicios (200 OK)', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token_cliente}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{gateway_url}}/api/servicios",
              "host": ["{{gateway_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "servicios"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3.3 Consultar Catálogo de Premios (GET)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Devuelve catálogo de premios de ms-premios (200 OK)', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token_cliente}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{gateway_url}}/api/premios",
              "host": ["{{gateway_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "premios"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3.4 Reservar Turno #1 (Sin Canje) -> 201 Created",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Turno #1 reservado en estado RESERVADO (201 Created)', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "    const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(data.estado).to.eql('RESERVADO');",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('turno_id_1', data.id);",
                  "    pm.environment.set('turno_id_1', data.id);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token_cliente}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"peluqueroId\": 1,\n  \"servicioId\": 1,\n  \"fechaHoraInicio\": \"2027-05-10T10:00:00\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{gateway_url}}/api/turnos",
              "host": ["{{gateway_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "turnos"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3.5 Completar Turno #1 (ADMIN) y Acreditar +100 Puntos -> 200 OK",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Turno #1 pasa a COMPLETADO y acredita puntos en ms-premios (200 OK)', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().estado).to.eql('COMPLETADO');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token_admin}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{gateway_url}}/api/turnos/{{turno_id_1}}/completar",
              "host": ["{{gateway_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "turnos", "{{turno_id_1}}", "completar"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3.6 Consultar Mi Cuenta de Puntos (Verifica +100 Puntos Acreditados)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Saldo de puntos incrementado tras completar turno (200 OK)', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    const cuenta = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(cuenta.saldoPuntos).to.be.at.least(100);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token_cliente}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{gateway_url}}/api/premios/mi-cuenta",
              "host": ["{{gateway_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "premios", "mi-cuenta"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3.7 Reservar Turno #2 Canjeando Premio #1 (10% Descuento) -> 201 Created",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Turno #2 reservado con 10% de descuento aplicado al precioFinal (201 Created)', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "    const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(data.porcentajeDescuentoAplicado).to.eql(10.0);",
                  "    pm.expect(data.precioFinal).to.eql(10800.0);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('turno_id_2', data.id);",
                  "    pm.environment.set('turno_id_2', data.id);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token_cliente}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"peluqueroId\": 1,\n  \"servicioId\": 1,\n  \"fechaHoraInicio\": \"2027-05-11T15:00:00\",\n  \"premioId\": 1\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{gateway_url}}/api/turnos",
              "host": ["{{gateway_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "turnos"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3.8 Cancelar Turno #2 y Reintegrar Puntos (RN-05) -> 200 OK",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Turno #2 pasa a CANCELADO y reintegra los 100 puntos en ms-premios (200 OK)', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().estado).to.eql('CANCELADO');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token_cliente}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{gateway_url}}/api/turnos/{{turno_id_2}}/cancelar",
              "host": ["{{gateway_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "turnos", "{{turno_id_2}}", "cancelar"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Reglas de Negocio y Rechazos Controlados",
      "description": "Verifica las validaciones del dominio y las respuestas de error esperadas (400, 409, 422).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "4.1 RN-01: Reserva Fuera de Franja Laboral (21:30 hs) -> 400 Bad Request",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('RN-01: Rechaza turno fuera de horario laboral (09:00 a 20:00) con 400 Bad Request', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(400);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token_cliente}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"peluqueroId\": 1,\n  \"servicioId\": 1,\n  \"fechaHoraInicio\": \"2027-05-12T21:30:00\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{gateway_url}}/api/turnos",
              "host": ["{{gateway_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "turnos"]
            }
          }
